sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N2 as nginx :11438 (TLS)
    participant WS as webui.sock
    participant W as Open WebUI :8080
    participant N1 as nginx :11437 (TLS)
    participant UP as llama_pool
    participant L as llama-server router<br/>(child model)

    B->>N2: https://localhost:11438 (UI + SSE)
    N2->>WS: proxy to unix socket
    WS->>W: TCP :8080
    W->>N1: OPENAI_API_BASE_URL https://172.31.0.1:11437/v1
    N1->>UP: proxy_pass
    UP->>L: unix socket via socat
    L-->>W: SSE / JSON
    W-->>B: stream (buffering off)
